{"id":"5043","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5043_main_cumulus-mediocris-cloud-street_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>云的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">垂直范围达到中等水平</span>约1500米（5000英尺），这是典型的中积云，但没有达到浓云云种所要求的较大垂直范围。在云顶和在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>处马上方正在发展中的细胞中可以看到小的突起。云是辐状云种，位于与风向平行的一条线（云街）中。 没有看到降水或附加特征。在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>处，可以在图像的右上角和左下角看可以看到碎积云（由于它位于云街的阴影中，所以是灰色的）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛圣布雷拉德","latitude":"纬度: 49° 10' 29'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 10' 38'' W","date":"15 August 2014 1634 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5043_syn_cumulus-mediocris-cloud-street_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在1200 UTC时，表面等压线中的广阔浅槽从瑞典一直延伸到法国西北部，而极地海上气流则覆盖了英国西部和法国西部。在拍摄照片前大约三个小时，附近的天气站报告了一个漏斗云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5043_upper_cumulus-mediocris-cloud-street_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>来自英国英格兰坎伯恩（WMO 03808）的探测是在拍摄照片前几个小时在同一极地海洋气流中开展的。探测显示出至760 hPa/2 400米是不稳定的低层大气。反演显示了高压对东大西洋的影响，并且可能在照片附近略低。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4993_main_cumulus-mediocris_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>图为中积云，这是一系列清晰轮廓的独立云；云底相对<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">较暗，几乎是水平的</span>，而顶部是被阳光照射的，显示为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的白色</span>。云层表现出适度的垂直发展，顶部有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">小突起和云芽</span>，是典型的中云云种。没有降水。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stefan Kämpfe","location":"德国爱尔福特","latitude":"纬度: 51° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 11° 0' 0'' E","date":"28 September 2015 1145 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.2"}]}]}